@SubletNest_HostAddress = http://localhost:5170

### Health Check
GET {{SubletNest_HostAddress}}/api/health
Accept: application/json

###

### Sign Up as a Leaser
POST {{SubletNest_HostAddress}}/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Rohan Sharma",
  "contact": "+91 9876543210",
  "email": "rohan@example.com",
  "password": "Password@123",
  "role": "Primary Leaseholder"
}

###

### Login using Email
POST {{SubletNest_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "rohan@example.com",
  "password": "Password@123"
}

###

### Login using Contact Number
POST {{SubletNest_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "+91 9876543210",
  "password": "Password@123"
}

###

### Login using Name
POST {{SubletNest_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "Rohan Sharma",
  "password": "Password@123"
}

###

### Get all users
GET {{SubletNest_HostAddress}}/api/auth/users
Accept: application/json

